WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Wishing for small ordinary things that have yet to come, I walked slowly through the fog.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.500
Now, even if it's too late, I want to hold onto the foolish thought of having surpassed it.

3
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:18.000
If only I could have loved more deeply, it might have been different.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Even though I should have been able to rely on you as if you understood.

5
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Even though it should have broken

6
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Sa sa sa

